---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Why curation matters. The thinking behind this list."
>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-page">

      <header class="about-header">
        <p class="about-label">About</p>
        <h1>Why curation matters.</h1>
      </header>

      <div class="about-body">
        <p>
          We live in an age of infinite choice. Every product category has hundreds of options,
          each with thousands of reviews, conflicting opinions, and paid placements designed
          to confuse rather than help.
        </p>

        <p>
          Curation is the opposite of that. It is the practice of doing the hard work of
          evaluation once — so you don't have to do it every time you need something.
        </p>

        <h2>The problem with more</h2>
        <p>
          More options create more anxiety, not more satisfaction. Research consistently shows
          that when faced with too many choices, people either choose poorly or don't choose
          at all. The paradox of choice is real, and it costs us time, money, and mental energy.
        </p>

        <h2>What good curation looks like</h2>
        <p>
          A good curated list is opinionated. It takes a position. It says: out of everything
          available, these are the ones worth your attention. Not because they are the cheapest,
          or the most popular, but because they are genuinely excellent.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every product on this list has been chosen deliberately. If it is here, there is a
          reason. If it is not here, there is a reason for that too.
        </p>

        <h2>About this list</h2>
        <p>
          This site is curated by <a href="https://hrithikagarwal.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Hrithik Agarwal</a>.
          The goal is simple: a short, honest list of products worth buying — with no filler,
          no sponsored rankings, and no noise.
        </p>
        <p>
          Some links are affiliate links. Commissions, if any, do not influence what gets
          listed here. A product is either worth recommending or it is not.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    max-width: 620px;
    padding: 4rem 0 6rem;
  }

  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .about-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-blue-400);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .about-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .about-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-body p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .about-body h2 {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-body a {
    color: var(--color-blue-600);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-blue-200);
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
  }

  .about-body a:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-blue-500);
  }
</style>
